  XC: Using PBE gradient-corrected functionals.
  Spin treatment: Spin density functional theory - collinear spins.
  Scalar relativistic treatment of kinetic energy: on-site free-atom approximation to ZORA.
  Geometry relaxation: Modified BFGS - TRM (trust radius method) for lattice optimization.
  Convergence accuracy for geometry relaxation: Maximum force <   0.100000E-03 eV/A.
  Requested output level: MD_light
  Convergence accuracy of self-consistent charge density:  0.1000E-06
